1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,320
Why do we lie,

2
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:02,120
even when telling the truth

3
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:03,650
wouldn't cost us anything?

4
00:00:03,650 --> 00:00:06,200
Think about a normal Monday morning.

5
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:08,200
You're standing by the coffee machine,

6
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:09,550
still half asleep,

7
00:00:09,550 --> 00:00:11,750
and a coworker looks over and asks,

8
00:00:11,750 --> 00:00:13,700
"Hey, how was your weekend?"

9
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:15,350
Maybe the real truth is

10
00:00:15,350 --> 00:00:17,200
that you barely left your apartment.

11
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:19,650
You spent most of Saturday on your phone,

12
00:00:19,650 --> 00:00:21,920
ate dinner straight out of a takeout container

13
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:23,450
at four in the afternoon,

14
00:00:23,450 --> 00:00:25,000
and went to bed early.
